<title>SPAIN: Spain's Sevillana appoints new chairman.</title>
<headline>Spain's Sevillana appoints new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Sevillana de Electricidad said on Tuesday it had appointed Manuel Otero Luna as its new chairman.</p>
<p>The statement, which follows press reports of the retirement of the previous chairman Fernando de Ybarra, added that Ybarra would be nominated honorary chairman of Fundacion Sevillana de Electricidad.</p>
<p>Otero Luna has been chief executive of the company since April 8.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
</text>
